<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-SOUTH AMERICAN SUPERCUP/COMNEBOL CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SOUTH AMERICAN SUPERCUP/COMNEBOL CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of South</p>
<p>American Supercup and Conmebol Cup matches played Wednesday.</p>
<p>Supercup, quarter-final, first leg</p>
<p>In Sao Jose do Rio Preto, Brazil: Santos (Brazil) 2</p>
<p>Atletico Nacional (Colombia) 0 (halftime 2-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Santos - Jean (26th), Jamelli (42nd)</p>
<p>In Buenos Aires: Velez Sarsfield (Argentina) 3 Olimpia</p>
<p>(Paraguay) 0 (2-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Jose Luis Chilavert (19th), Patricio Camps</p>
<p>(43rd), Christian Bassedas (85th)</p>
<p>Note: the Supercup is played every year between past</p>
<p>winners of the Libertadores.</p>
<p>Conmebol Cup second round, first leg</p>
<p>In Asuncion: Guarani (Paraguay) 0 Lanus (Argentina) 2</p>
<p>(0-1)</p>
<p>Scorers: Oscar Mena (34th), Gaston Coyotte (66th)</p>
</text>
